a, collection points, and AI use. Make one permission decision Resolve identity, jurisdiction, purpose, and policy once instead of rebuilding logic in every tool. Enforce it everywhere Propagate the decision across connected systems and keep an auditable record. Data Sentry Data Mapping AI Sentry Collection points Website Mobile app Ad platforms Systems and AI CRM Data warehouse AI assistant Live inventory Data types Collection points Purposes of use Jurisdictions Systems AI activity Sync & monitoring The Ketch Platform See everything, control everything, use everything — safely Discovery, Permissioning, and Growth are one value chain, not three products: find every data flow, enforce every permission, and activate the data you can trust. Discovery . See data Know what data exists, where it flows, and how AI systems use it before risk compounds. Data Sentry Data Mapping Data Discovery & Classification AI Governance Permissioning . Control data Enforce consent, rights, policy, and intended use across every connected system in real time. Consent Management DSR Automation Risk Management Growth . Use data, safely Activate permissioned data for AI, advertising, and personalization customers can trust. Marketing Preference Management Progressive Consent Profile Management Key use cases Six core workflows, one connected system — from consent capture and DSRs to data mapping, website compliance, marketing preferences, and AI-ready profiles. Everything your privacy program runs on Discovery Understand your data footprint Map systems, flows, and processing activity so you know what data you hold and how it moves. More on Data Mapping Permissioning Collect and enforce privacy choices Capture consent everywhere and enforce it across every connected system in real time. More on Consent Management Growth Capture marketing preferences Give customers granular control and turn permissioned preferences into trusted growth. More on Marketing Preferences Discovery Verify website privacy compliance Reveal privacy vulnerabilities before regulators or plaintiffs' attorneys find them. More on Data Sentry Permissioning Automate data subject requests Intake, verify, and fulfill DSRs end to end, with an auditable trail for every request. More on DSR Automation Growth Build AI-ready customer profiles Profile Management stores consent, identity, preferences, and first-party data as one profile. More on Profile Management AI privacy that observes, recommends, and acts Ketch Agent Network The Ketch Agent Network is the orchestration layer that powers every product in the Ketch platform, continuously gathering the context privacy teams need instead of chasing by hand: regulations, policies, contracts, data repositories, collection points, access controls, and Ketch configuration. Explore Ketch Agent Network Legal obligations Laws, enforcement actions, and settlement terms — synthesized as they land, mapped to where you operate. The regulatory baseline every decision gets measured against. Documented policies The version of your program that exists on paper. Policies, compliance documentation, and stated commitments — what you've told the world you do with data. Operational reality Live activity across your applications, code, configurations, and data systems. The reality layer — what's collecting, what's flowing, what's firing, and what's leaving — whether anyone documented it or not. Legal Requirements Public Attestations Data Repositories Settlements & Enforcement Ketch Agent Network Compliance Docs Collection Points Ketch Configs Access Controls Knowledge Base Observe live context Track regulations, policies, contracts, repositories, collection points, and Ketch configuration. Recommend the work Draft assessments, evidence, reports, and configuration changes for review. Act with approval Move approved decisions into connected privacy workflows and keep an auditable record. The world's data permissioning layer Ketch runs the consent, preference, and data-rights signals behind 3,500+ consumer brands. Consent and preference signals 44,133,025,702 +3,061 / sec Opt-ins, opt-outs, and preference updates, everywhere Ketch runs. Privacy edge requests served 83,901,451,511 +4,064 / sec Consent experiences delivered from Ketch's edge network. Data-rights requests honored 3,616,036 +398,141 / day Deletions, access, and opt-outs fulfilled end to end. Worldwide data 2026 to date Privacy Huddle Hear it from the leaders at the heart of it all Short stories from privacy, legal, marketing, and security leaders. Watch Full Episodes Episode #103 Unpacking the record $17 billion Meta settlement, plus U.S. Privacy Summit updates Full Episode Episode #101 Verizon’s privacy counsel on risk assessments, children’s privacy, & leveraging AI Full Episode Episode #100 What happens when two adtech nerds walk into a privacy bar? (spoiler: they build a company) Full Episode Episode #97 Buy Your CISO a Coffee: Advice on CCPA, Amendments, Identity & More Full Episode Episode #93 CLA Annual Privacy Summit Hot Topics Full Episode Episode #91 Privacy Hot Topics Full Episode Product tour See consent enforcement work end to end Click through an ungated Ketch workflow after seeing how the platform and Agent Network fit together. All Product Tours Take a Tour Ketch named a Leader in the 2026 Gartner ® Magic Quadrant™ for Privacy UX Gartner evaluates vendors in this market on Ability to Execute and Completeness of Vision. We believe this placement reflects a platform that connects consent, identity, and activation in one system. Get a Demo Get the Full Report Gartner, Magic Quadrant for Privacy UX, Shadrock Roberts, Stefan Dumitrescu, Bernard Woo, Published 6 October 2026. Built for your whole team One source of truth, shared by every team Colleen Barry Head of Marketing at Ketch Ketch for marketers Ketch turns consent, preferences, identity, and profile data into a Growth-layer system for AI-ready audiences and first-party personalization. Learn More Marketing Jack Carvel Head of Legal & DPO at Ketch Ketch for legal teams Ketch turns consent, rights, data maps, and risk workflows into audit-ready permissioning infrastructure legal teams can operate without waiting on engineering. Learn More Legal Vivek Vaidya Co-Founder & CTO at Ketch Ketch for engineers Ketch gives privacy engineering teams APIs, webhooks, Identity Sync, Transponder, and production-scale permissioning primitives. Learn More Engineering Anton Winter Co-Founder & Head of Infrastructure at Ketch Ketch for IT & security Ketch helps security teams observe Shadow AI, detect risky data flows, and keep AI systems aligned to consent, policy, and audit evidence. Learn More IT & security Show me the plan for my role Pricing for the team that has to live with it Map where data lives, enforce the choices people make about it, and act on the data already cleared to use, all from the same platform rather than separate tools bolted together. CISO and Security CMO and Growth Privacy Operations Engineering Your security needs AI-era permissioning That audit, legal, and security can defend SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001 / 27701, RBAC, SSO, and SCIM out of the box. Permission Vault keeps consent receipts, lawful basis, and policy decisions as auditable evidence. RBAC, SSO, SCIM with org-scoped tokens Permission Vault with audit-grade evidence Real-time AI Sentry catches unauthorized data use Ketch for Security Teams Recommended for you Ketch Pro Custom pricing Pro covers enterprise-grade governance, single-tenant data residency, and migration support. Try Ketch Free First Get a Demo Customers Proof from teams turning privacy into operating infrastructure Voices from legal, marketing, and privacy operations teams already running on Ketch. Read Customer Stories Thank you for making software that lawyers can use. I can make adjustments quickly and confidently within Ketch without needing to speak code. John Dombrowski Associate General Counsel for Compliance and IP, The RealReal Ketch has helped us grow interdepartmentally. I now receive messages from departments asking for privacy input. Julie Libby Privacy Manager, Renaissance The Ketch team is incredibly responsive. I cannot recall ever having this level of support from a vendor. Andrew Williams Senior Digital Marketing Manager, Spreedly Ketch is the persistent, pervasive layer of consent across our digital touchpoints — it protects our customers and it protects us. Jennifer Peters Director of DTC, MarTech, and Digital Compliance, OLLY When we saw Ketch in action and how their team was thinking about their offering, we knew they were on the same page as us. Kelsey Reinhardt Director of Data Engineering, Forbes Read Reviews on G2 Start free , then expand into the full permissioning stack Launch a full-feature CMP at $0/month, then add Discovery, Permissioning, and Growth workflows as your program matures. Get a Demo Get Started Free Get started in less than 5 min Permissioning infrastructure for the AI era — proven at 67.2B consent transactions a month. Get a Demo Get Started Free Log In 140 New Montgomery, San Francisco, CA 94105 +1 (415) 737-6489 Platform Platform Overview Ketch Agent Network Ketch Free AI Governance Consent Management DSR Automation Identity Management See All Products → Solutions Retail & E-Commerce Technology Financial Services Healthcare Communications & Media Automotive Travel & Hospitality Education Resources Blog Product Tours Regulations Hub US Privacy Law Atlas Enforcement Analysis Privacy Huddle Integrations Documentation Compare vs. OneTrust vs. TrustArc vs. BigID vs. DataGrail vs. Securiti vs. Transcend vs. Privado vs. Osano Company About Customers Pricing News Careers Partners Contact us The Privacy Huddle Amtrak’s privacy leader on how to win allies and budget for your privacy program Episode #104 | Sep 24, 2026 Browse All Episodes The Ketch up newsletter Monthly privacy intel. No fluff Enforcement actions, regulator moves, and product news — written for privacy operators. Once a month, straight to your inbox. Work email Sign Up We dogfood our own consent stack. Unsubscribe any time. Certifications and recognition © 2026 Ketch Kloud, Inc. All rights reserved. Privacy Policy Terms of Service Trust & Security Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information Your Privacy Choices Sitemap"
